# CO-ADMIN-005 — Enterprise Product & Lender Master

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED**

## Principles

- Products and Lenders are **Master Data** (Enterprise Registry).
- No hard-coded product lists for operational dropdowns.
- Opportunity / Deal / Customer product selections consume Product Master (registry-first, canonical fallback).
- Lender selections consume Lender Registry.
- Product–Lender offers configured via matrix (`productsSupported` + programs) — never hard-coded lender lists.

## SSOT

- Canonical seed: `src/constants/enterprise-product-master/`
- Runtime options: `src/lib/enterprise-product-master/`
- Product Registry API: `/api/product-registry`
- Product Master UI: `/admin/product-library/master`
- Matrix UI: `/admin/product-lender-matrix`
- Baseline programs (CO-PROG-004): one-time create-missing seed — `seedBaselineCommercialPrograms` · `docs/co-prog-004/CO-PROG-004-DEFAULT-LENDER-PROGRAM-SEEDING-READINESS-REPORT.md` · **no website auto-sync**
